Package: transientDTU
Type: Package
Title: Detect Transient Diverge-Reconverge Transcript Usage
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Robin", "Gounder", email = "robin@kohze.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Russell", "Hamilton", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Converts stage-specific differential transcript usage results into
    explicit, bounded diverge-reconverge episodes. The package accepts generic
    pairwise contrast tables from upstream differential usage methods, supports
    preflight input auditing and configurable replicate-level robustness
    checks, annotates reciprocal exchanges, and produces deterministic
    candidate rankings. It also provides simulation, threshold-stability,
    benchmarking, visualization, and 'SummarizedExperiment'-compatible
    workflows for evaluating the operating characteristics of the decision
    layer.
